  unitName: Auric Echo Eleanor
  unitId: 40867
  unitNumber: 1510
  description: Eleanor vanished when the Arena inexplicably collapsed during the
    Zektasa's rematch with the mystery swordsman. The Arena was never rebuilt afterwards,
    and the Zektasa disbanded. Nothing is known of her fate afterwards. Although
    she developed numerous spells suited to the small-group combat of the Arena,
    those spells have not been passed down to the present era. Had the Arena been
    rebuilt, she might have returned and developed even more spells which could have
    been passed down to the current generation.
  summonDesc: I'm a bit relieved that the Arena is restored. I want more people to
    see us... No...to see him fight.
  fusionDesc: Rest assured that this power is now in good hands. I keep getting new
    ideas for spells to use, after all!
  evoDesc: The cheering crowds! The ground soaked in blood and sweat! Hehe... It
    seems like this place really is the only home for me.
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
